# Which site this build serves. Each deployment gets its own scope.
# Allowed values: regelverk, ot, it, fysisk, brandskydd, el, arbetsmiljo
#
# If unset, the scope is resolved from the request hostname
# (<scope>.regelverk.org in prod, <scope>.localhost in local testing),
# falling back to "regelverk".
#
# Note: switching between path-based URLs (/ot/...) in dev and
# subdomain URLs (https://ot.regelverk.org/...) in prod is automatic —
# it follows SvelteKit's `dev` flag (vite dev vs build/preview).
SITE_SCOPE=
